OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLow cloud lingering around some
OL,6,Fcoasts, with hazy sunshine inland. A
OL,7,Ffew heavy and possibly thundery
OL,8,Fshowers possible in the afternoon.
OL,9,FFeeling hot in the sunshine, with
OL,10,Flight winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers clearing the far east
OL,13,Fin the evening, then generally staying
OL,14,Fdry overnight with clear spells.
OL,15,FRemaining warm in urban areas, with a
OL,16,Flight northwesterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
