OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA dry and bright day for
OL,6,Fmany, with plenty of sunny spells.
OL,7,FPerhaps the odd light shower in the
OL,8,Fnorth first thing. A pleasant feeling
OL,9,Fday, with light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry
OL,12,Fwith sunny spells on Sunday and
OL,13,FMonday. Gradually turning cloudy
OL,14,Fthrough Tuesday, with the chance of
OL,15,Fshowers in places. Temperatures nearer
OL,16,Fto average, but still on the warm side.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
